0..60 Comment "/// This source converts a call through another call result."
61..64 Comment "///"
65..129 Comment "/// It specifies checker and kernel steps at calls stuck on `h`."
130..133 Comment "///"
134..182 Comment "/// `tailOf(h)` is the argument of another call."
183..218 Comment "/// The checker expands both calls."
219..257 Comment "/// The kernel replays that expansion."
258..338 Comment "/// The arm reads back as a bind of `tailOf(h)` ahead of the call that it feeds."
339..342 Comment "///"
